    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετά-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>change</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				895b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πραγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>MM</u>
					1207b12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κατὰ μετάπτωσιν ἐνόχλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					154
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ βίος ἀδήλους τὰς μ. ἔχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Mon.</u>
					581
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἄλληλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.1.36
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				335.128
			</span></i> (Pergam.); -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεις λημμάτων,
			λόγων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.7.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.2.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ . . εἰς μ. ἔσται ὁ
			ἀγρός</span> if it shall be <i>transferred</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3702
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mysia</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐκ τύχης ἄνω καὶ κάτω μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					2.29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
